WEBVTT

00:00:04.435 --> 00:00:05.435
(GROANS)

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:08.355
This is not working.
Are we getting close?

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.955
SADNESS: Yeah, just another right.

00:00:10.755 --> 00:00:15.235
And...a left and then another...left and...

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.915
Uh, are you sure
you know where we're going?

00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:20.715
Because we seem to be
walking away from Headquarters.

00:00:21.915 --> 00:00:23.635
Riley's awake.

00:00:23.955 --> 00:00:25.115
Ooh! Oh!

00:00:26.355 --> 00:00:27.515
(EXCLAIMS NERVOUSLY)

00:00:27.595 --> 00:00:29.075
Don't touch. Remember?

00:00:29.155 --> 00:00:31.675
If you touch them, they stay sad.

00:00:31.795 --> 00:00:35.115
Oh, sorry, I won't. Starting now.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.435
Oh, I can't take much more of this.

00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:38.915
FORGETTER BOBBY: Forget them!

00:00:39.155 --> 00:00:40.195
Mind workers!

00:00:40.275 --> 00:00:41.435
But, Joy, we're almost...

00:00:41.635 --> 00:00:42.635
(SIGHS)

00:00:42.995 --> 00:00:43.995
Phone numbers.

00:00:44.155 --> 00:00:45.715
We don't need all these.
They're in her phone.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.755
-Excuse me, hi.
-Just forget all of that. Please. Forget it!

00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:50.955
-I need to find Friendship Island.
-Look at this.

00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:52.675
Four years of piano lessons.

00:00:52.835 --> 00:00:53.875
FORGETTER BOBBY: Yeah,
it looks pretty faded.

00:00:53.955 --> 00:00:55.395
You know what? Save Chopsticks

00:00:55.475 --> 00:00:56.795
and Heart and Soul, get rid of the rest.

00:00:57.555 --> 00:00:58.955
-Are you...
-US Presidents. What do you think?

00:00:59.115 --> 00:01:00.955
Yeah, just keep
Washington, Lincoln and the fat one.

00:01:01.235 --> 00:01:02.395
-Forget 'em!
-Hey!

00:01:02.475 --> 00:01:03.595
You can't throw those away!

00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:04.755
Those are perfectly good memories.

00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:07.275
The names of
every "Cutie Pie Princess" doll?

00:01:07.395 --> 00:01:09.115
Yes! That is critical information!

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.475
JOY: Glitterstorm, Honeypants...

00:01:10.595 --> 00:01:11.595
Forget 'em!

00:01:16.795 --> 00:01:17.875
Hey! Bring those back!

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:20.075
They're in the dump. Nothing
comes back from the dump.

00:01:20.195 --> 00:01:21.675
Yeah. Look, lady, this is our job, okay?

00:01:21.795 --> 00:01:23.875
When Riley doesn't care
about a memory, it fades.

00:01:24.115 --> 00:01:25.635
-Fades?
-Happens to the best of them.

00:01:25.795 --> 00:01:29.275
Yeah, except for this bad boy.
(LAUGHS) This one will never fade.

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:31.675
MAN: ♪ TripleDent gum
WOMAN: ♪ Will make you smile ♪

00:01:31.835 --> 00:01:33.195
(GASPS) The song
from the gum commercial?

00:01:33.315 --> 00:01:34.315
You know, sometimes we send that one

00:01:34.475 --> 00:01:35.475
up to Headquarters for no reason.

00:01:35.555 --> 00:01:38.075
It just plays in Riley's head
over and over again.

00:01:38.155 --> 00:01:39.635
-Like a million times!
-(LAUGHS)

00:01:39.795 --> 00:01:41.035
Let's watch it again!

00:01:41.195 --> 00:01:42.275
♪ TripleDent gum ♪

00:01:42.355 --> 00:01:44.235
Yeah, I know. We all know the song.

00:01:44.355 --> 00:01:45.715
Okay. Yeah, real catchy. Okay.

00:01:45.795 --> 00:01:46.795
Hey, what do you think?
Should we do it?

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:47.915
Yeah!

00:01:48.075 --> 00:01:49.555
Okay, here we go!

00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:51.235
(BOTH LAUGHING)

00:01:52.915 --> 00:01:53.915
♪ TripleDent gum ♪

00:01:54.035 --> 00:01:55.355
What the... This again?

00:01:55.795 --> 00:01:56.795
(SINGING ALONG)

00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:59.115
Wait! Do you know how to
get to Friendship Island?

00:01:59.515 --> 00:02:00.555
♪ TripleDent gum ♪

00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:02.675
Do you like it there?
Did you feel any earthquakes?

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:03.755
Is the bridge cool?

00:02:04.035 --> 00:02:05.275
Yeah, it's good.

00:02:05.515 --> 00:02:06.555
What happened with the playoffs?

00:02:06.675 --> 00:02:07.675
We won the first game.

00:02:07.755 --> 00:02:09.875
Coach says we might actually
go to the finals this year.

00:02:10.035 --> 00:02:11.675
Oh, and we've got
this new girl on the team.

00:02:11.795 --> 00:02:12.875
She's so cool.

00:02:13.035 --> 00:02:14.595
Uh, she did not just say that.

00:02:14.675 --> 00:02:16.915
A new girl? Meg has
a new friend already?

00:02:17.035 --> 00:02:19.155
-(ANGER GRUMBLING)
-Hey, hey! Stay happy!

00:02:19.275 --> 00:02:21.195
We do not want to lose
any more islands here, guys!

00:02:21.515 --> 00:02:22.515
MEG: We can pass
the puck to each other

00:02:22.595 --> 00:02:25.035
without even looking.
It's like mind reading!

00:02:25.275 --> 00:02:26.515
You like to read minds, Meg?

00:02:26.595 --> 00:02:28.315
I got something
for you to read, right here!

00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:29.475
Let's just be calm for one second! Ahhh!

00:02:29.555 --> 00:02:30.555
(YELLING)

00:02:30.795 --> 00:02:32.195
-MEG: I heard they have parrots...
-I've got to go.

00:02:32.395 --> 00:02:33.755
-What?
-I got to go!

00:02:35.035 --> 00:02:36.475
Okay, could you just please
tell me which way is...

00:02:36.635 --> 00:02:38.155
(BOTH CHATTERING)

00:02:38.235 --> 00:02:39.355
-(RUMBLING)
-Oh, no!

00:02:42.635 --> 00:02:44.355
Friendship Island! What?

00:02:55.635 --> 00:02:57.355
Oh, not Friendship.

00:02:59.115 --> 00:03:00.595
(BOTH LAUGHING)

00:03:03.435 --> 00:03:07.715
Oh, Riley loved that one.
And now it's gone.

00:03:08.275 --> 00:03:09.595
Goodbye, friendship.

00:03:09.675 --> 00:03:11.195
-(SIGHS)
-Hello, loneliness.

00:03:11.275 --> 00:03:12.395
(GRUMBLING)

00:03:15.755 --> 00:03:17.955
We'll just have to go the long way.

00:03:18.475 --> 00:03:22.995
Yeah. The long, long, long, long way.

00:03:24.195 --> 00:03:25.315
SADNESS: I'm ready.

00:03:25.755 --> 00:03:28.715
(GROANS) There's got to be
a better way.

00:03:28.795 --> 00:03:29.795
-(BING BONG HUMMING)
-(GASPS)

00:03:31.075 --> 00:03:32.675
BING BONG: Ooh! Look at you!

00:03:32.755 --> 00:03:33.755
Huh?

00:03:34.035 --> 00:03:36.435
I will take you, but not you.

00:03:36.715 --> 00:03:38.715
Oh, who am I kidding? I can't leave you.

00:03:39.275 --> 00:03:40.755
-Hello!
-(BING BONG EXCLAIMS)

00:03:40.955 --> 00:03:42.155
Wait! Hey! Wait!

00:03:43.435 --> 00:03:44.435
(CLATTERING)

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:45.715
Oh, wait! Stop!

00:03:51.275 --> 00:03:52.475
(BING BONG PANTING)

00:03:54.635 --> 00:03:55.755
-Excuse me.
-Ah!

00:03:56.635 --> 00:03:59.435
Uh, I was looking for, um... Diversion!

00:03:59.515 --> 00:04:01.355
-JOY: What?
-Ha-ha! So long, sucker!

00:04:01.475 --> 00:04:02.475
(CLATTERING)

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:04.075
BING BONG: Ow, I hurt all over.

00:04:04.155 --> 00:04:05.715
Wait. I know you.

00:04:05.915 --> 00:04:07.675
No, you don't. I get that a lot.

00:04:08.315 --> 00:04:09.355
I look like a lot of people.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.115
No, no, no. I do. (GASPS)

00:04:11.235 --> 00:04:13.795
Bing Bong! Riley's imaginary friend!

00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:16.355
-You really do know me?
-Well, of course!

00:04:16.515 --> 00:04:18.915
Riley loved playing with you!
You two are best friends!

00:04:19.075 --> 00:04:20.515
Oh! Oh, you would know.

00:04:20.595 --> 00:04:21.795
We're trying to get
back to Headquarters.

00:04:21.915 --> 00:04:23.915
Headquarters? You guys
are from Headquarters?

00:04:24.075 --> 00:04:26.635
Well, yeah. I'm Joy. This is Sadness.

00:04:26.915 --> 00:04:28.795
-You're Joy? The Joy?
-JOY: Mmm-hmm.

00:04:28.875 --> 00:04:30.435
What the heck are you doing out here?

00:04:30.515 --> 00:04:32.675
That's a good question.
You want to answer that, Sadness?

00:04:32.755 --> 00:04:35.755
Wow. Without you,
Riley won't ever be happy.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:38.155
We can't have that.
We got to get you back.

00:04:38.235 --> 00:04:39.555
I'll tell you what. Follow me!

00:04:39.675 --> 00:04:41.075
Oh, thank you!

00:04:41.315 --> 00:04:42.995
It is so great to see you again.

00:04:43.075 --> 00:04:45.235
I gotta tell you, I am such
a huge fan of your work.

00:04:45.395 --> 00:04:47.755
Do you remember when you
and Riley were in a band?

00:04:47.835 --> 00:04:50.395
(LAUGHS) I went to all of your concerts.

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:51.755
BING BONG: Yeah, I blow a mean nose.

00:04:51.835 --> 00:04:53.475
JOY: Watching you play tag
was such a treat.

00:04:53.555 --> 00:04:54.915
BING BONG: Two-time world champ.

00:04:55.035 --> 00:04:56.555
JOY: Oh! And remember your rockets?

00:04:56.675 --> 00:04:58.715
BING BONG: Of course!
It runs on song power!

00:04:58.995 --> 00:05:00.475
That's right! Your theme song!

00:05:00.555 --> 00:05:01.835
♪ Who's your friend who likes to play?

00:05:01.915 --> 00:05:03.195
♪ Bing Bong
Bing Bong

00:05:03.275 --> 00:05:04.595
♪ His rocket makes you yell "Hooray!"

00:05:04.755 --> 00:05:06.075
BOTH: ♪ Bing Bong, Bing Bong ♪

00:05:06.675 --> 00:05:08.875
What exactly are you supposed to be?

00:05:09.035 --> 00:05:11.555
You know, it's unclear.
I'm mostly cotton candy.

00:05:11.635 --> 00:05:16.315
But shape-wise I'm part cat,
part elephant, part dolphin.

00:05:16.555 --> 00:05:17.715
Dolphin?

00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:18.995
(MIMICS DOLPHIN CLICKING)

00:05:20.555 --> 00:05:22.035
You got to remember,
when Riley was three,

00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:23.515
animals were all the rage.

00:05:23.595 --> 00:05:25.275
The cow goes moo.
The horse goes neigh.

00:05:25.595 --> 00:05:26.955
That's all people talked about back then.

00:05:27.035 --> 00:05:28.475
Yeah. Yeah. I guess that's true.

00:05:28.635 --> 00:05:29.635
What are you doing out here?

00:05:29.755 --> 00:05:33.155
Well, there's not much call
for imaginary friends lately.

00:05:33.235 --> 00:05:35.595
So, uh, I, you know, um...

00:05:35.995 --> 00:05:37.035
(SIGHS)

00:05:37.475 --> 00:05:39.595
Hey, hey. Don't be sad.

00:05:39.915 --> 00:05:41.995
Tell you what. When I get
back up to Headquarters,

00:05:42.075 --> 00:05:43.835
I'll make sure Riley remembers you.

00:05:44.155 --> 00:05:45.435
-You will?
-Of course!

00:05:45.555 --> 00:05:47.595
-She'd love that.
-(LAUGHING)

00:05:47.715 --> 00:05:49.875
This is the greatest day of my life!

00:05:49.995 --> 00:05:51.715
Ha, cha, cha, cha, cha. Ow!

00:05:51.795 --> 00:05:53.915
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:54.035 --> 00:05:55.155
Oh, are you okay?

00:05:55.595 --> 00:05:56.755
Hey, what's going on?

00:05:56.955 --> 00:05:58.475
I cry candy.

00:05:58.595 --> 00:06:00.075
Try the caramel. It's delicious.

00:06:00.195 --> 00:06:01.515
Ooh. Whoa!

00:06:02.075 --> 00:06:03.675
Ooh, here, use this.

00:06:03.795 --> 00:06:05.275
-Thanks!
-Whoa, hold on, wait a second.

00:06:07.595 --> 00:06:08.635
(GRUNTING)

00:06:09.075 --> 00:06:10.795
It always gets stuck at the bottom.

00:06:12.115 --> 00:06:13.355
-(TRUMPET BLOWS)
-(CAT SCREECHING)

00:06:13.515 --> 00:06:16.395
Here. What? It's imaginary.

00:06:16.755 --> 00:06:18.555
Thanks. This will make it a lot easier

00:06:18.635 --> 00:06:19.715
to walk back to Headquarters.

00:06:19.795 --> 00:06:21.395
Walk? We're not walking.

00:06:21.635 --> 00:06:23.635
We're taking the Train of Thought!

00:06:24.275 --> 00:06:25.275
(HORN BLARING)

00:06:25.355 --> 00:06:27.115
JOY: The train, of course!

00:06:27.275 --> 00:06:29.795
That is so much faster!
But how do we catch it?

00:06:29.915 --> 00:06:31.595
Well, it kind of goes all over the place,

00:06:31.675 --> 00:06:32.675
but there is a station
in Imagination Land.

00:06:34.315 --> 00:06:36.635
I know a shortcut. Come on, this way!

00:06:36.995 --> 00:06:39.115
JOY: Oh, I am so glad we ran into you!

00:06:39.675 --> 00:06:42.275
The station is right
through here. After you.

00:06:42.475 --> 00:06:43.635
-Joy.
-What?

00:06:43.835 --> 00:06:45.435
I read about this place

00:06:45.515 --> 00:06:47.115
in the manual. We shouldn't go in there.

00:06:47.315 --> 00:06:49.235
Bing Bong says
it's the quickest way to Headquarters.

00:06:49.315 --> 00:06:51.395
No, but, Joy, this is abstract thought.

00:06:51.475 --> 00:06:52.595
What are you talking about?

00:06:52.675 --> 00:06:55.435
I go in here all the time.
It's a shortcut, you see?

00:06:55.635 --> 00:06:59.195
D-A-N-G-E-R. Shortcut.
I'll prove it to you.

00:07:00.395 --> 00:07:03.275
Look at me. I'm closer to the station

00:07:03.475 --> 00:07:05.195
because I'm taking the shortcut.

00:07:05.675 --> 00:07:07.595
Let's go around. This way.

00:07:07.675 --> 00:07:09.275
BING BONG: Almost there!

00:07:10.355 --> 00:07:12.675
If you want to walk the long way, go for it.

00:07:12.795 --> 00:07:14.755
But Riley needs to be happy.

00:07:14.875 --> 00:07:16.315
I'm not missing that train.

00:07:16.475 --> 00:07:17.675
Bing Bong knows what he's doing.

00:07:17.915 --> 00:07:19.795
JOY: He's part dolphin.
They're very smart.

00:07:19.995 --> 00:07:21.595
SADNESS: Well, I guess.

00:07:24.515 --> 00:07:26.355
GIRL 1: What did you get?
GIRL 2: I don't know.

00:07:26.635 --> 00:07:27.995
(INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS)

